#: story/eggs.gd:598
msgid "1ST PLACE"
msgstr "第一名"

#: story/eggs.gd:654
msgid "The duck squeaks a secret: \"%s\" unlocks the %s design."
msgstr "鸭子吱吱地说出一个秘密：“%s”可以解锁 %s 外观。"

#: story/eggs.gd:655
msgid "The duck has taught you everything it knows. Quack."
msgstr "鸭子已经把它知道的全教给你了。嘎。"

#: story/eggs.gd:805
msgid "Curiosity found: %s  (%d / %d)   %s"
msgstr "发现奇物：%s（%d / %d）   %s"

#: story/eggs.gd:816
msgid "Every curiosity on the list, found. Lumi's collection compartment is very full of memories."
msgstr "清单上的奇物全部找到了。Lumi 的收藏舱装满了回忆。"

#: story/first_seed.gd:9
msgid "Wait. Hold it up to the light."
msgstr "等等。对着光举起来看看。"

#: story/first_seed.gd:10
msgid "That's a Maker seed tin. Cradle stamp on the lid. One of ours, left behind in the rush."
msgstr "那是造物者的种子罐。盖子上有 Cradle号的印章。是我们的，匆忙中落下的。"

#: story/first_seed.gd:11
msgid "When they left, the Makers sealed every seed they could carry into the Cradle's vault. Your vault, Lumi."
msgstr "离开时，造物者把能带走的每一颗种子都封进了 Cradle号的种子库。你的种子库，Lumi。"

#: story/first_seed.gd:12
msgid "The plan was simple. Wait for the dust to settle. Come home. Plant. They called that day the Greenfall."
msgstr "计划很简单。等尘埃落定。回家。播种。他们把那一天称为 Greenfall。"

#: story/first_seed.gd:13
msgid "Then three hundred years went by, and the dust never settled. Until a seed-keeper fell out of the sky."
msgstr "然后三百年过去了，尘埃从未落定。直到一个守种者从天上掉了下来。"

#: story/first_seed.gd:14
msgid "Nothing grows on its own anymore. The soil forgot how. Somebody has to put it in the ground."
msgstr "现在什么都不会自己长了。土地忘了怎么长。得有人把种子种进土里。"

#: story/first_seed.gd:15
msgid "That somebody is you. Small. Stubborn. Running on four percent. Perfect."
msgstr "那个人就是你。小小的。倔强的。只剩百分之四的电。完美。"

#: story/first_seed.gd:16
msgid "Find clean ground. Dig. Drop it in. Pat it down. And then — this part matters — water it."
msgstr "找到干净的地面。挖坑。放进去。拍拍土。然后——这步很重要——浇水。"

#: story/first_seed.gd:119
msgid "Lumi. I'm getting a signal. Green, faint, east of the hub. An old greenhouse. Go look."
msgstr "Lumi。我收到一个信号。绿色的，很微弱，在基地东边。一座旧温室。去看看。"

#: story/first_seed.gd:151
msgid "Find clean ground.  Hold  {scoop}  to plant.  {tool_water}  for the watering can, hold  {scoop}  to water."
msgstr "找到干净的地面。按住  {scoop}  种植。按  {tool_water}  拿水壶，按住  {scoop}  浇水。"

#: story/first_seed.gd:221
msgid "...It's green. Lumi, it's actually green."
msgstr "……是绿色的。Lumi，真的是绿色的。"

#: story/first_seed.gd:223
msgid "Keep it watered. Plant more. Every bloom gives you seeds back, and a little green light for your core. This is how it starts."
msgstr "继续浇水。多种一些。每朵花都会还你种子，还有一点给核心的绿光。一切就是这样开始的。"

#: story/intro.gd:253
msgid "Three hundred years ago, the last seeds left Verdance aboard the ark Cradle."
msgstr "三百年前，最后的种子乘着方舟 Cradle号离开了 Verdance。"

#: story/intro.gd:271
msgid "Lumi, the ark's little seed-keeper, sang to the seedlings every night."
msgstr "Lumi，方舟上的小小守种者，每晚都为幼苗唱歌。"

#: story/intro.gd:284
msgid "Humming again, Lumi? They can't hear you, you know. ...They do grow faster when you do."
msgstr "又在哼歌了，Lumi？它们听不见的，你知道吧。……不过你唱的时候，它们确实长得更快。"

#: story/intro.gd:303
msgid "Then, one night, the sky came apart."
msgstr "然后，某天夜里，天空碎裂了。"

#: story/intro.gd:335
msgid "Hull breach in the vault bay! Lumi, leave the trays, get clear!"
msgstr "种子库舱段船体破裂！Lumi，别管托盘了，快离开！"

#: story/intro.gd:398
msgid "Lumi— hold on— I can't turn her around— hold on—"
msgstr "Lumi——坚持住——我没法让它调头——坚持住——"

#: story/intro.gd:411
msgid "The ark could not turn back. The pod fell for days."
msgstr "方舟无法回头。逃生舱坠落了好几天。"

#: story/intro.gd:583
msgid "...Lumi? ...Lumi. The relay's barely holding, but I've got you. You're down. You're on Verdance."
msgstr "……Lumi？……Lumi。中继快撑不住了，但我联系上你了。你着陆了。你在 Verdance 上。"

#: story/intro.gd:590
msgid "Your core runs on green light, the glow living things give off. There's no green left down there. That's why you're fading."
msgstr "你的核心靠绿光运转，就是生命散发的那种光。下面已经没有绿色了。所以你在慢慢熄灭。"

#: story/intro.gd:593
msgid "So we make some. Clean the ground, plant those seedlings. Every bloom feeds your core."
msgstr "那我们就造一些出来。清理地面，种下那些幼苗。每一朵花都会滋养你的核心。"

#: story/intro.gd:600
msgid "Fill your Bloom Core. Rebuild a launch site. Then you fly home to us. ...One can at a time."
msgstr "充满你的绽放核心。重建一座发射场。然后飞回我们身边。……一壶水一壶水地来。"

#: story/intro.gd:663
msgid "%s  skip"
msgstr "%s  跳过"

#: story/intro.gd:663
msgid "Space / Esc"
msgstr "空格 / Esc"

#: story/intro.gd:704
msgid "GREEN LIGHT  ·  NONE DETECTED"
msgstr "绿光  ·  未检测到"

